{"articleNo":"110547","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=110547&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"희망이음 프로젝트 기업탐방 참여학생 모집 홍보","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2014.08.05","hit":"2947","attachments":[{"name":"2014 희망이음 프로젝트 경북지역 우수기업탐방(8~9월) 세부계획.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=110547&attachNo=73840"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment--><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\">[희망이음 프로젝트 기업탐방 참여학생 모집 홍보]</font></strong></span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp; <!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></font></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">희망이음 프로젝트는 산업통상자원부가 주최하고 한국산업기술진흥원</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">(KIAT)</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">과 경상북도가 주관하며 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">TP</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">가 참여하는 사업으로써</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">지역 우수기업과 청년인재</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">대학생</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">졸업생등 취업준비생</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">의 만남의 장을 통하여 기업정보도 취득하고 수상의 기회도 얻을 수 있습니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">기업별 탐방학생을 선착순 모집 중이오니 관심있는 분들의 많은 신청 바랍니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span></font></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></font></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">* </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">진행 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">재단법인 경북테크노파크</span></font></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></font></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></font></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">1. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">탐방기업</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">일시</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">) </span></font></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></font></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1) (</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">주</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff;